{"id":"c87db4d1858a0009","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-strength.md","title":"真理理论强度","display":"df-truth-strength — 真理理论强度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-strength","aliases":["91-df-truth-strength","91-df-proof-theoretic-strength"],"display":"df-truth-strength — 真理理论强度","depends_on":["[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-strength</span><span>91-df-proof-theoretic-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-strength — 真理理论强度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f744fc361db0ee96\" href=\"?note=f744fc361db0ee96\" title=\"91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories\">91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-strength-—-真理理论强度-$\\mathrm{Str}$\">df-truth-strength — 真理理论强度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Str}\">\\(\\mathrm{Str}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2\">\\(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2\\)</span> (待比较的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_1\\cap\\mathcal L_2}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_1\\cap\\mathcal L_2}\\)</span>\n(共同语言中的比较句子类)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_1)\n\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_1)\n\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相应地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_1\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2)\n\\land(\\mathcal T_2\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_1),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_1\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\land\n\\neg(\\mathcal T_2\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_1\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2)\n\\land(\\mathcal T_2\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_1),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_1\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\land\n\\neg(\\mathcal T_2\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>：相对于指定后果类的证明强度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理论强度的含义：\n后果包含是直接的强度定义。证明论序数是经过独立序数分析后可能得到的一种不变量，不能用未保证唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\\alpha\\,\\operatorname{PTO}(\\mathcal T,\\alpha)\">\\(\\iota\\alpha\\,\\operatorname{PTO}(\\mathcal T,\\alpha)\\)</span> 直接定义。</p>\n<p>常用校准必须固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 与理论版本。例如取算术句子为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 时，标准、无额外真理语言归纳的 TB、UTB 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 对 PA 保守，因而在该预序下与 PA 等强。若给 CT、\nKF、FS 或 VF 加入不同强度的归纳、规则或反射原则，比较结果可能改变。\n因此不能脱离精确公理版本把 FS、KF、VF 排成一条无条件强度链，也不能\n把某个文献中的分层真理或归纳定义校准直接当作名称本身的定义。</p>\n<p>强度与保守性的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 保守的扩展：与基础理论在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上等强</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 非保守的扩展：在该后果预序中严格强于基础理论</li>\n<li>强度增量：反映真理归纳的贡献</li>\n</ul>\n<p>证明理论序数的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>序数是理论证明能力的度量</li>\n<li>证明论序数只对具有合适有效表示并完成序数分析的理论定义；并非每个递归理论都附带一个可直接计算的唯一序数</li>\n<li>序数比较提供理论强弱的精确刻画</li>\n</ul>\n<p>强度的实际含义：\n更强的理论可能证明更多良基性或递归终止命题；把这种现象表示为具体\n证明论序数仍需要一套独立、已证明正确的序数分析。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-strength-—-真理理论强度-$\\mathrm{Str}$","text":"df-truth-strength — 真理理论强度 $\\mathrm{Str}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories","status":"resolved","id":"f744fc361db0ee96","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Str}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_1\\cap\\mathcal L_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_1)\n\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_1\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2)\n\\land(\\mathcal T_2\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_1),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_1\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\land\n\\neg(\\mathcal T_2\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota\\alpha\\,\\operatorname{PTO}(\\mathcal T,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":2795,"backlinks":[{"id":"0cefcc7942834ee1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}$\n(算术后果等价, see [[91-df-truth-strength]])"},{"id":"aa2ad816ed17d60f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"99cc98508e51c9ee","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"37e8c28d922b32f1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7443277cb04c8e58","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d0dc2670ffdd2806","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8f32f747a261016d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b69b13179ecbdd3e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e17f40587f032600","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c096df80861122dd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],